This repository contains documentation, screenshots, architecture diagrams,
designs, and other materials describing the BloomBelly project ("the Work"),
which has been submitted as a graduation thesis to the Informatics Engineering
College at Al-Sham Private University (ASPU), Damascus, Syria, in 2026,
under the academic supervision of Dr. Afaf Al-Shalabi and Eng. Rahaf Abdul Qader.

The Work is the joint proprietary and confidential property of Mozn Jamous
and Shahd Bureghsh.

